    {
      "name": "dsh-cloudflare-codemode",
      "title": {
        "en": "Cloudflare Code Mode",
        "zh-cn": "Cloudflare 全功能管家"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Connect Cloudflare's official Code Mode MCP to DeepSeek Harness. The model gets search and execute over 2,500+ Cloudflare API endpoints (Workers, Pages, DNS, R2, KV, D1, Zero Trust), with a settings panel for OAuth 2.1 or API token. Credentials stay on this machine.",
        "zh-cn": "把 Cloudflare 官方 Code Mode MCP 接入 DeepSeek Harness。AI 通过 search 与 execute 访问 2,500+ Cloudflare API（Workers、Pages、DNS、R2、KV、D1、Zero Trust），并附带 OAuth 2.1 / API Token 双认证设置面板；凭据只存本机。"
      },
